{
    "title": "Local News: Headlines & Alerts",
    "description": "<b>Your Ultimate Local News Companion</b>\r\nStay connected with your community and beyond with Local News, the top news aggregator for U.S. local news enthusiasts. Focused on delivering the latest and most relevant local stories, weather alerts, and events, Local News keeps you updated on everything happening in your area.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n<b>Personalized News Feed</b> \r\nAccess a diverse range of news categories\u2014politics, crime, sports, entertainment, finance, health, and lifestyle\u2014customized to your interests. Our app aggregates trusted media sources for a tailored news experience.\r\n<b>Customized Push Notifications</b> \r\nStay informed with real-time notifications on breaking news, local events, and important updates. Receive alerts that matter most to you.\r\n<b>Local Events & Weather Alerts</b> \r\nExplore local events, fairs, and festivals happening this weekend near you. Get timely weather alerts and enjoy local video content. Connect with like-minded neighbors in the comments section.\r\n<b>Morning & Evening Roundup Podcast</b> \r\nStart and end your day with our curated podcasts, offering the day's top stories and insights. Enjoy personalized news coverage with your favorite voices.\r\n\r\nLocal News is your go-to source for engaging, comprehensive local coverage. Stay connected with the latest updates and happenings, all tailored to your interests.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Your Ultimate Local News Companion</b><br>Stay connected with your community and beyond with Local News, the top news aggregator for U.S. local news enthusiasts. Focused on delivering the latest and most relevant local stories, weather alerts, and events, Local News keeps you updated on everything happening in your area.<br><br>Key Features:<br><b>Personalized News Feed</b> <br>Access a diverse range of news categories\u2014politics, crime, sports, entertainment, finance, health, and lifestyle\u2014customized to your interests. Our app aggregates trusted media sources for a tailored news experience.<br><b>Customized Push Notifications</b> <br>Stay informed with real-time notifications on breaking news, local events, and important updates. Receive alerts that matter most to you.<br><b>Local Events &amp; Weather Alerts</b> <br>Explore local events, fairs, and festivals happening this weekend near you. Get timely weather alerts and enjoy local video content. Connect with like-minded neighbors in the comments section.<br><b>Morning &amp; Evening Roundup Podcast</b> <br>Start and end your day with our curated podcasts, offering the day&#39;s top stories and insights. Enjoy personalized news coverage with your favorite voices.<br><br>Local News is your go-to source for engaging, comprehensive local coverage. Stay connected with the latest updates and happenings, all tailored to your interests.",
